    {
      "text": "I changed `ripcord.yml` so the backup now includes the `mealie-data` named volume, which is mounted at `/app/data/` in the `mealie` service. That volume is where Mealie keeps uploaded recipe images, so a restore that only covered the Postgres database lost the Jollof Rice photo (the `original.webp` request failed) even though the row counts matched.",
